# S-08 — Public catalogue (#1–#7, #9). Result 30 Sep 2026 (dev DB + db/reference/002 seed): all as expected.
# home: 4 featured, 4 causes, 6 courses, 7 sponsorable, 4 books, impact, general fund 143900.00/500000.00 = 28 %
# products: 15 published; books price_asc by cheapest format; sponsorable=true → 7 open offers; fields=slug → 15 rows
# search: ar_normalize (حِكَايَات → "حكايات الحروف"; مكتبة ≡ مكتبه); sort=cheap → 400 validation.failed
# detail: course (5 modules, 184/300 seats = 61 %), book formats (print available 500, max 20; digital max 1),
# cause (72400.00/190000.00 = 38 %, daysLeft in Riyadh days); unknown slug → 404 catalog.product_not_found
# live: unknown slugs omitted; 51 slugs → 400 · updates/feed: empty on the seed (no orders yet) · config: settings
# caching: Cache-Control public, max-age=60, stale-while-revalidate=300 (live: max-age=15), weak ETag, If-None-Match → 304
@base = http://localhost:5080/v1/catalog

### #1 Home
GET {{base}}/home

### #2 Categories
GET {{base}}/categories

### #3 Products (cards) — filters: type, category, sponsorable, q, sort, page, pageSize
GET {{base}}/products?type=book&sort=price_asc

### #3 Arabic search (tashkeel and letter variants normalised)
GET {{base}}/products?q=حِكَايَات

### #3 fields=slug (prerender routes)
GET {{base}}/products?fields=slug

### #3 Unknown sort → 400 validation.failed
GET {{base}}/products?sort=cheap

### #4 Product page
GET {{base}}/products/digital-teacher

### #4 Unknown slug → 404 catalog.product_not_found
GET {{base}}/products/nope

### #5 Live figures (≤ 50 slugs)
GET {{base}}/live?slugs=digital-teacher,science-stars-book,learning-data

### #6 Cause updates
GET {{base}}/products/water-for-schools/updates

### #7 Gift feed (RUL-23)
GET {{base}}/products/water-for-schools/feed

### #9 Config
GET {{base}}/config

### ETag round trip → 304
GET {{base}}/categories
If-None-Match: W/"<etag from the previous response>"
